Routed experts split in three quantization tiers for ik_llama.cpp (DeepSeek V4 graph).

Base: ikawrakow/ik_llama.cpp at c446f1e089f3dc2436b0600596c23abde00d988f, with ik_routing.patch applied first.
Apply, from the ik_llama root:  git apply ik_tiers.patch
Each layer's routed experts are read from blk.L.tK.ffn_{gate,up,down}_exps.weight (K = 0..2) plus the index table
blk.L.tK.ffn_exps_map.weight; the graph, the loader and the backend scheduler follow.
Test: tests/test-moe-tiers.cpp (target test-moe-tiers).
check_ik_patches.sh checks that both patches apply on the base commit.

